    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>Plant a totem in your space. Once per round it makes one ranged touch attack against an enemy within 30 feet; you choose the target as a free action. The ward has Precise Shot and attacks with your base attack bonus + your Spirit modifier. A hit deals 1d6 fire damage per three caster levels, maximum 5d6.</p><p>The totem has AC 7, hardness 5, and 5 hit points. Destroying it ends the spell.</p><p><strong>Automation boundary:</strong> Create and place the ward, choose its target, resolve its attack each round, and track its defenses and destruction manually.</p>"
    },
